  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)-Mercdees Pattern Making and Garment Construction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MercDees Ventures is a unique professional Fashion Hub established in 2016 by DejiAyodele Oluwatoyin Deji-Ayodele. The company is a tailoring service that also provides training and development, to protential fashion entrepreneurs. The project will train professional sewing machine operators in industrial sewing techniques, pattern drafting and fashion illustration. Mercdees Ventures will place trainees in paid internships upon completion.</narrative>
  </description>
